OL,3,GNEWSAPolice worker jailed over child
OL,4,Asex offence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police staff member has been jailed
OL,7,Ffor six years after trying to arrange
OL,8,Fsexual activity with a child.
OL,10,FChristopher Thompson, 33, from
OL,11,FDoncaster, was working for West
OL,12,FYorkshire Police in the force's
OL,13,Fregional scientific support services at
OL,14,Fthe time of his arrest.
OL,16,FDet Ch Supt Tanya Wilkins said he had
OL,17,Fbeen involved in some "concerning
OL,18,Fbehaviour online" and as part of this
OL,19,Fhad tried to arrange sexual activity
OL,20,Fwith a child.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
