OL,3,GNEWSAPolice worker jailed over child
OL,4,Asex offence
OL,5,
OL,6,FThompson was sentenced at Grimsby Crown
OL,7,FCourt on Tuesday after earlier being
OL,8,Ffound guilty of trying to arrange
OL,9,Fsexual activity with a child under 13
OL,10,Fas well as two counts of making
OL,11,Findecent photographs of a child and
OL,12,Fsending communication conveying a
OL,13,Fthreatening message.
